e/UT Central Allocation in Rs C rore \nTotal  "}, {"k": "questions|ls|16|9|UNSTARRED |829", "t": "Assessment of MGNREGS in Karnataka", "head": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA\nMINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT\nDEPARTMENT OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT\nLOK SABHA\nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 829\nTO BE ANSWERED ON 21.07.2016\nASSESSMENT OF MGNREGS IN KARNATAKA\n829. SHRI B. N. CHANDRAPPA:\nWill the Minister of RURAL DEVELOPMENT be pleased to state:\n(a) the details of works took up under the Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment\nGuarantee Scheme (MGNREGS) in Karnataka during the last three years, district-wise;\n(b) the details of funds allocated, released and spent under MGNREGS, during the last\nthree years in the State; and\n(c) the details of funds allocated to Karnataka in the current financial year?\nANSWER\nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT\n(SHRI RAM KRIPAL YADAV)\n(a): District-wise details of the works taken up under Mahatma Gandhi National Rural\nEmployment Guarantee Scheme (MGNREGS) in Karnataka during the last three years are given in\nAnnexure-I.\n(b)&(c): Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment Guarantee Act (MGNREGA) is a demand\ndriven programmes hence no State/UT- wise allocation of fund is made. The Central funds are released\nto the States/UTs including Karnataka on the basis of agreed to Labour Budget and taking into\nconsideration the performance and the pace of utilization of available funds. Details of amount released\nand expenditure to Karnataka under the MGNREGS during the last three years and the current year is\nindicated in Annexure-II.\n*****\n\nAnnexure-I referred to in reply to part(a) of Lok Sabha Unstarred Question No. 829 dated 21.07.2016\nNo. District\nWorks Taken up\nNATURAL RESOURCES\nMANAGEMENT\nINDIVIDUAL ASSETS FOR\nVULNERABLE SECTIONS\nCOMMON INFRASTRUCTURE\nFOR NRLM COMPLIANT SELF\nHELP GROUPS RURAL INFRASTUCTURE\n2013-14 2014-15 2015-16 2013-14 2014-15 2015-16 2013-14 2014-15 2015-16 2013-14 2014-15 2015-16\n1 BAGALKOTE 7901 